{"quest":"oteryn:quest.tower_defence_quest","rules":[{"effects":[{"kind":"set_topic","value":1}],"guards":[{"kind":"storage","op":"lt","track":"oteryn:quest-progress/quest/u8_1/tower_defence_quest/questline","value":1}],"key":"oteryn:quest-npc/tower-defence/offer","keywords":["mission"],"npc":"oteryn:npc.bunny_bonecrusher","quest":"oteryn:quest.tower_defence_quest","reply":["Normally we don't assign missions to civilians - and particularly to MALE civilians - but in this case I think we can make an exception. ...","I need a courier to deliver a parcel to the watchtower in Femor Hills. You think you can handle that??"],"sources":["crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/bunny_bonecrusher.lua:66-67"],"trigger":"say"},{"effects":[{"kind":"set_topic","value":2}],"guards":[{"kind":"storage","op":"eq","track":"oteryn:quest-progress/quest/u8_1/tower_defence_quest/questline","value":4}],"key":"oteryn:quest-npc/tower-defence/request-password","keywords":["mission"],"npc":"oteryn:npc.bunny_bonecrusher","quest":"oteryn:quest.tower_defence_quest","reply":["Alright, you delivered the parcel. So what is the password Thanita told you?"],"sources":["crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/bunny_bonecrusher.lua:71-71"],"trigger":"say"},{"effects":[{"count":1,"item":"oteryn:item.tibia.i140","kind":"give_item"},{"kind":"set","track":"oteryn:quest-progress/quest/u8_1/tower_defence_quest/questline","value":1},{"kind":"set_topic","value":0}],"exclude_keywords":["mission"],"guards":[],"key":"oteryn:quest-npc/tower-defence/accept","keywords":["yes"],"npc":"oteryn:npc.bunny_bonecrusher","quest":"oteryn:quest.tower_defence_quest","reply":["I am not sure if I should be glad now or not but anyway ... you will get a password so I will know if you just threw it away or actually delivered it. Here is the parcel. See you ....or not."],"sources":["crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/bunny_bonecrusher.lua:75-75"],"topics":[1],"trigger":"say"},{"effects":[{"count":50,"item":"oteryn:item.tibia.i762","kind":"give_item"},{"count":50,"item":"oteryn:item.tibia.i774","kind":"give_item"},{"count":50,"item":"oteryn:item.tibia.i763","kind":"give_item"},{"count":50,"item":"oteryn:item.tibia.i761","kind":"give_item"},{"kind":"set","track":"oteryn:quest-progress/quest/u8_1/tower_defence_quest/questline","value":5},{"kind":"set_topic","value":0}],"exclude_keywords":["mission"],"guards":[],"key":"oteryn:quest-npc/tower-defence/reward","keywords":["password*"],"npc":"oteryn:npc.bunny_bonecrusher","quest":"oteryn:quest.tower_defence_quest","reply":["That's right. Here is your reward some elementary arrows. You did pretty well on your mission!"],"sources":["crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/bunny_bonecrusher.lua:80-80"],"topics":[2],"trigger":"say"},{"effects":[{"count":1,"item":"oteryn:item.tibia.i140","kind":"take_item"},{"kind":"set","track":"oteryn:quest-progress/quest/u8_1/tower_defence_quest/questline","value":2},{"kind":"set","track":"oteryn:quest-progress/quest/u8_1/tower_defence_quest/door","value":2},{"kind":"set_topic","value":0}],"guards":[{"kind":"storage","op":"eq","track":"oteryn:quest-progress/quest/u8_1/tower_defence_quest/questline","value":1}],"key":"oteryn:quest-npc/tower-defence/deliver-parcel","keywords":["mission"],"npc":"oteryn:npc.thanita","quest":"oteryn:quest.tower_defence_quest","reply":["Oh great! Supplies from Carlin! Let me see ...<she digs into the parcel>...ahh, nothing meaningful at all, like always. Well, before I give you the password for the delivery, you have to help me! ...","I have massive problems with the goblin tribe that lives here. You look strong enough to face their leader but you need to be smart to lure him out. ...","I heard they don't like fire very much, maybe that's worth a try. Their beds are mostly made of straw which is known as easily inflammable. ...","The entrance to their cave is at the pond south east of here."],"sources":["crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/thanita.lua:66-69"],"trigger":"say"},{"effects":[{"kind":"set","track":"oteryn:quest-progress/quest/u8_1/tower_defence_quest/questline","value":4},{"kind":"set_topic","value":0}],"guards":[{"kind":"storage","op":"eq","track":"oteryn:quest-progress/quest/u8_1/tower_defence_quest/questline","value":3}],"key":"oteryn:quest-npc/tower-defence/receive-password","keywords":["mission"],"npc":"oteryn:npc.thanita","quest":"oteryn:quest.tower_defence_quest","reply":["Impressive!! I could need someone like you here at the watchtower! Okay, the password you need to tell Bunny is ' password* '. Come back and visit me if you like to!"],"sources":["crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/thanita.lua:75-75"],"trigger":"say"}],"schema":1,"tracks":[{"initial":0,"key":"oteryn:quest-progress/quest/u8_1/tower_defence_quest/questline","max":5,"min":0,"quest":"oteryn:quest.tower_defence_quest","sources":["crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/bunny_bonecrusher.lua:64-85"]},{"initial":0,"key":"oteryn:quest-progress/quest/u8_1/tower_defence_quest/door","max":2,"min":0,"quest":"oteryn:quest.tower_defence_quest","sources":["crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/thanita.lua:64-72"]}]}
